    [Doc][Misc] Update GLM-5.3-Flash deployment guide for A2 series (#19664)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates only the Common Prefill and Common Decode serving
    templates in the GLM-5.3-Flash A2 deployment documentation.
    
    The template updates synchronize the documented parameters with the
    refreshed A2 service scripts, including:
    
    - Runtime timeout and profiler environment settings.
    - 1M context length and role-specific scheduler limits.
    - INT8 main and indexer KV cache settings.
    - MTP speculative decoding settings.
    - MC2, FlashComm1, shared-expert, and static-kernel additional
    configuration.
    - Prefill and Decode Mooncake KV ports.
    - Prefix-cache retention and the Decode HCCL port-isolation settings.
    
    The surrounding deployment topology, launcher commands, wrappers, proxy
    configuration, and other documentation remain based on the community
    guide.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this is a documentation-only update.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Compared the two Common serving templates with the refreshed A2
    service scripts.
    - Checked the local vLLM 0.30 CLI source for `--additional-config` and
    the serving argument defaults.
    - Passed `markdownlint`, `codespell`, `typos`, and `git diff --check`.
    
    No full GLM-5.3-Flash A2 NPU startup was run because the available
    container does not contain the GLM-5.3-Flash deployment environment.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
